{"id":"7eb62978269b937a","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-kleene-post-theorem.md","title":"Kleene–Post Incomparable Degrees","display":"thm-kleene-post-theorem — Kleene–Post Incomparable Degrees","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-kleene-post-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-kleene-post-theorem"],"display":"thm-kleene-post-theorem — Kleene–Post Incomparable Degrees","depends_on":["[[68-df-turing-degree]]","[[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§15 proposition 15.2 pp.54-55 / PDF 63-64","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"argument-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-kleene-post-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-kleene-post-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kleene-post-theorem — Kleene–Post Incomparable Degrees"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"43fcc2f44ce938e0\" href=\"?note=43fcc2f44ce938e0\" title=\"68-df-turing-degree\">68-df-turing-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"341dbc6a97001587\" href=\"?note=341dbc6a97001587\" title=\"68-df-incomparable-degrees\">68-df-incomparable-degrees</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§15 proposition 15.2 pp.54-55 / PDF 63-64"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"argument-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"43fcc2f44ce938e0\" href=\"?note=43fcc2f44ce938e0\" title=\"68-df-turing-degree\">68-df-turing-degree</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mid\">\\(\\mid\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"341dbc6a97001587\" href=\"?note=341dbc6a97001587\" title=\"68-df-incomparable-degrees\">68-df-incomparable-degrees</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\;(\\mathbf a\\mid\\mathbf b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\;(\\mathbf a\\mid\\mathbf b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 15.2 先构造两个不可比的全实数，再以图和收缩换成集合代表。逐个交替处理两方向的 oracle 程序：若兼容有限延伸能使当前计算收敛，就固定该有限延伸并使目标值不同；若不能收敛，目标值任取。每步补定义最小未定义输入，保证两个实数全定义。这项不声称构造为 r.e.，后者由 15.5 单独处理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-incomparable-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"341dbc6a97001587","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，$\\mid$ 见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-incomparable-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"341dbc6a97001587","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，$\\mid$ 见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mid","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\;(\\mathbf a\\mid\\mathbf b).","display":true}],"bytes":1200,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-kleene-post-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-kleene-post-theorem|thm-kleene-post-theorem — Kleene–Post Incomparable Degrees]]"}],"outgoing":["43fcc2f44ce938e0","341dbc6a97001587"]}